&control
  calculation='scf', prefix='CoCl2', outdir='./tmp',
  pseudo_dir='/work/lab/tools/pseudo/gbrv', tprnfor=.true., tstress=.true.,
  etot_conv_thr=1e-5, forc_conv_thr=1e-4, disk_io='low'
/
&system
  ibrav=0, nat=3, ntyp=2,
  ecutwfc=50, ecutrho=400, vdw_corr='dft-d3', dftd3_version=4,
  occupations='smearing', smearing='mv', degauss=0.01,
  nspin=2,
  starting_magnetization(1)=0.5,
/
&electrons
  conv_thr=1e-09, mixing_beta=0.3, electron_maxstep=200
/
ATOMIC_SPECIES
Co 58.933 co_pbe_v1.2.uspp.F.UPF
Cl 35.453 cl_pbe_v1.4.uspp.F.UPF
HUBBARD (ortho-atomic)
U Co-3d 4.00
CELL_PARAMETERS angstrom
  1.78523785 1.03070756 5.78669473
  -1.78523785 1.03070756 5.78669473
  0.00000000 -2.06141510 5.78669473
ATOMIC_POSITIONS crystal
Co -0.00000000 0.00000000 -0.00000000
Cl 0.25636195 0.25636195 0.25636195
Cl -0.25636195 -0.25636195 -0.25636195
K_POINTS automatic
